<title>HUNGARY: Hungary six-month T-bill yield drops to 20.47 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary six-month T-bill yield drops to 20.47 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on Hungary's six-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 20.47 percent, down from 20.69 percent at an auction held two weeks ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     17,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	46,978.81 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    17,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 18,500 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    20.47 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     90.7384 pct</p>
<p>Further details..... HTBO</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
